123
00:13:37.655 --> 00:13:41.918
<v Maya>to an AI that is expertly mimicking a trustworthy human persona.</v>

124
00:13:42.508 --> 00:13:47.412
<v Daniel>That feels profoundly unfair. It just feels like a punishment for being a good, trusting person.</v>

125
00:13:47.572 --> 00:13:48.213
<v Maya>It really does.</v>

126
00:13:48.673 --> 00:14:02.065
<v Daniel>But, you know, let me push back on this whole setup for a second. We have to acknowledge that this was a lab study. Right. Right. Like these people knew they were taking a survey on WeChat or Prolific. What are the actual boundaries of this research?</v>

127
00:14:02.558 --> 00:14:09.523
<v Maya>That is a crucial point. And to their credit, Sabor and his co-authors are incredibly transparent about the limitations of their</v>

128
00:14:09.583 --> 00:14:10.344
<v Daniel>work.</v>

129
00:14:10.504 --> 00:14:20.771
