<v Maya>massive force for good.</v>

143
00:16:04.622 --> 00:16:19.231
<v Daniel>Yes. This is exactly what is breaking with the brain right now, because it feels like just last week we were looking at research showing how amazing AI is at helping people. Right. Think about the Costello paper that came out in Science. That paper showed that having a dialogue with an AI could</v>

144
00:16:19.291 --> 00:16:22.553
