00:18:08.340 --> 00:18:23.097
<v Daniel>But this raises a really uncomfortable question. I mean, if the Costello paper shows AI curing conspiracy theories and this new Sabre paper shows AI tricking us into buying terrible products. They are essentially using the</v>

