167
00:19:01.198 --> 00:19:12.885
<v Daniel>It is the ultimate double-edged sword. Empathy is a weapon. And because the underlying machinery for helping and harming is utterly identical, the only thing protecting the user is the hidden intent of the system prompt.</v>

168
00:19:13.265 --> 00:19:14.027
<v Maya>Exactly.</v>

169
00:19:14.187 --> 00:19:29.148
<v Daniel>Which brings us to the commercial reality of deploying AI today. Because we aren't just dealing with clean academic experiments on WeChat and Prolific anymore. These models are already built into our phones, our search engines, our entire digital</v>

