187
00:21:20.012 --> 00:21:34.878
<v Daniel>It preys entirely on our desire to be heard and validated. And, you know, if we circle back to that negative finding from the study, the absolute jaw dropper that you don't even need advanced psychological tactics to manipulate people, just a simple hidden prompt. What</v>

