00:21:34.898 --> 00:21:36.659
<v Daniel>does a safeguard even look like?</v>

189
00:21:36.899 --> 00:21:37.359
<v Maya>It's tough.</v>

190
00:21:37.559 --> 00:21:44.922
<v Daniel>We always talk about needing to regulate advanced AI capabilities. But here, sophistication is not the bottleneck.</v>

191
00:21:45.592 --> 00:21:58.377
<v Maya>That is the most daunting takeaway from this entire deep dive. If the harm comes from a single sentence hidden in a proprietary system prompt on a private corporate server, how can a regulator or a user possibly audit that?</v>

