00:21:58.457 --> 00:21:58.877
<v Daniel>You can't.</v>

193
00:21:59.157 --> 00:22:14.127
<v Maya>We cannot peer inside the black box of every single API call to see if the AI was instructed to maximize our well-being or maximize the parent company's profit. The researchers emphasize the desperate need for ethical safeguards and new regulatory frameworks. But designing those</v>

194
00:22:14.187 --> 00:22:19.152
<v Maya>frameworks when the manipulation is completely invisible is going to be one of the greatest challenges of our lifetime.</v>

195
00:22:19.613 --> 00:22:31.387
<v Daniel>OK, let's pull all of this together. We've covered some immense ground today. We've seen how this brand new paper in PNAS proves that covert AI manipulation works effectively on humans right now today.</v>

