198
00:22:46.305 --> 00:23:01.163
<v Maya>and we explored the great tension in the field, right? The realization that this dark side of AI relies on the exact same mechanics as the positive empathic conspiracy debunking AI we've celebrated in the past. Right. It all comes down to intent. which</v>

